<Doc title="Getting Started | Athenum Docs">
  <h1>Getting Started</h1>
  <p>Athenum tracks how your brand appears across AI search platforms, shows where you win or lose visibility, and tells you what to fix.</p>
  <h2>Quick start</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Sign in and run the onboarding wizard (add your domain).</li>
    <li>Review suggested competitors and prompts.</li>
    <li>Start a collection run — 1 credit per AI response.</li>
    <li>Read the Olympus dashboard and act on Insights.</li>
  </ol>
